Ukem
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRAW 96 DEAL COLUMN
COLUMN 6 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 0 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 2 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 0 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE COLUMN COLUMN
AND
    DEST Size == 9
    OR
        SRC Rank K
        SRC Suit {DIAMONDS, SPADES}
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
        PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
